/-! # FLOWER-LOW (L8 helper L8-I-UNITS), item I: the block gap of an ingredient at the group gap kind

Main's `Stage1.ingredient_gap_eq` (FinalCount.S1Gaps) and `Flower.MkMark.{ingredient_blockGap_kind,
ingredient_blockGap_of_groupGapKind}` (I-GATE declarations no sub-area had taken; claimed by I-UNITS in PROGRESS.md).
Copied by source (sha256 in `MkUnits/COPIED-SHA256SUMS`) onto L5a's `𝒱_γ` API (`Fama`), L6's carrier `Src` and the
other item-I sub-areas' ports; statements are main's over `𝒱_{γF}` at `γF ≤ 1/2`. Generated by the helper's
`itool/gen_u_spec.py` (L8's `gen_i_spec.py` naming). -/

@[expose] public section
